 "applies_to": "IBC boilers (up to 24) on a BoilerNet 2-wire bus, served to BACnet IP through the BoilerNet Interface Controller.",
 "summary": "The BIC is a stand-alone controller that connects to up to 24 IBC boilers over the BoilerNet 2-wire bus and publishes them on BACnet IP. Each boiler appears as a 'Boiler xx' block of temperature, pressure, run-hour, load and status objects, plus a master block for the BoilerNet master. It also has a built-in web server for remote control.",
