 "notes": [
  "The sheet prints one boiler block named 'Boiler xx ...' at instances 1001-1019 (AI 1001-1011); xx stands for the boiler number. It does not say how instances shift for the other boilers.",
  "Commandable objects are those ticked in the sheet; the rest are listed read-only.",
  "The sheet gives no state texts for the multistate objects.",
  "The V-10 touchscreen controller has its own object list with different instance numbers."
 ],
